WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Ask. Start with a question that names a field, unit and threshold.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Validate. Allow only defined fields and comparisons rather than executing generated Python.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Inspect. Link the same selected records to map outlines and charts.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Challenge. Move a threshold and observe how sensitive the selection is to the question.
